Hi=C2=A0B6,

**=F0=9F=99=8C=F0=9F=8F=BB****Collaborate****more****effectively****with =
Creately=C2=A0**
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D

Creately offers powerful collaboration features that make it easy to work =
together on any type of project and streamline teamwork effectively.

Better engage distributed and remote teams in brainstorming, planning, =
processes, meetings and workshops, and decision-making with Creately =
workspaces that enable both asynchronous and synchronous collaboration =
=E2=80=94 just as easily as if everyone were in the same room.=C2=A0

**Concurrent editing**
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D

View changes others make on the workspace in real-time with synced previews=
 as if you were sitting next to each other.

**Real-time mouse cursors**
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D

Color-coded mouse cursors for any number of collaborators to track how they=
 contribute and engage on the workspace.=C2=A0

**Offline Sync**
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D

Keep your work saved and updated at all times, even when you go offline.=
=C2=A0

**Contextual comments=C2=A0**
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D

Add comments wherever on the workspace to share feedback. Use @mention =
comments to tag people and comment threads to have discussions and =
follow-ups on the same canvas.

**Smart notifications=C2=A0**
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D

Stay informed about relevant actions that occur in the app via the correct =
channel.=C2=A0

Ready to collaborate with your teammates=3F=C2=A0
=C2=A0

[Open Creately](https://app.creately.com/)

For more information on Creately=E2=80=99s features, click [here.=
](https://creately.com/tour/)

=C2=A0

If you have any other questions or concerns, reply to this email and we =
will get back to you soon.

